| Property | Type                    | Description                                                                                                        | Default |
|:---------|:------------------------|:-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------|:--------|
| Weak     | `bool`                  | Enables weak validators. Weak ETags are easier to generate but less reliable for comparisons. | `false` |
